{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 工程实践MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent 的 Token 成本是如何控制的？有哪些策略？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工程实践\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工程实践\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"Agent 的 Token 成本是如何控制的？有哪些策略？\" dir=\"auto\">Agent 的 Token 成本是如何控制的？有哪些策略？</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">生产环境的 Agent 系统月均 Token 消耗可能高达数千万，如何在不影响质量的前提下控制成本？</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>一、成本结构分析</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 总成本 = LLM Input Token × 单价 + LLM Output Token × 单价 + 工具 API 费用 + 基础设施费用</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">通常 Output Token 单价是 Input 的 3-5 倍，<strong>优化重点是减少 Output Token 和模型降级</strong>。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>二、五大成本控制策略</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>策略 1：模型路由（最大收益，降本 60%+）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ModelRouter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"按任务复杂度自动分配模型\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    MODEL_CONFIG <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"simple\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"model\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4o-mini\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>      <span class=\"token comment\"># $0.15/1M input</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"max_tokens\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">256</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"temperature\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.1</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"medium\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"model\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4o\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>            <span class=\"token comment\"># $2.5/1M input</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"max_tokens\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">512</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"temperature\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.3</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"complex\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"model\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4o\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>            <span class=\"token comment\"># 复杂任务才用重模型</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"max_tokens\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">2048</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"temperature\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.5</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">route</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> context_len<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"根据查询特征路由到合适模型\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_is_simple_query<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> context_len<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>MODEL_CONFIG<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"simple\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_is_medium_query<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>MODEL_CONFIG<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"medium\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>MODEL_CONFIG<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"complex\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_is_simple_query</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> ctx<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"简单查询特征：FAQ类、短文本、无推理需求\"\"\"</span>\n        patterns <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"什么时候\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"多少钱\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"怎么联系\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"地址在哪\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">any</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>p <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> query <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> p <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> patterns<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">and</span> ctx <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">1000</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>策略 2：Prompt 压缩（降本 20%）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">PromptCompressor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"Prompt 压缩工具\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">compress_system_prompt</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> original<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"System Prompt 从 1500 tokens 精简到 800 tokens\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 去除冗余描述</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 使用结构化格式替代自然语言</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 工具描述按需动态注入</span>\n        compressed <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_remove_redundancy<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>original<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        compressed <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_structure_format<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>compressed<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> compressed\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">compress_context</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> history<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">2000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"对话历史摘要压缩\"\"\"</span>\n        total_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_count_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>history<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> total_tokens <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;=</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> history\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 保留最近 N 轮，早期轮次压缩为摘要</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 每 10 轮压缩一次，摘要控制在 200 Token 内</span>\n        summary <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_summarize_old_rounds<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>history<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>summary<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> history<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>策略 3：多层次缓存（降本 15-20%）</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MultiLayerCache</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"4 层缓存架构\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>l1_exact <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>      <span class=\"token comment\"># L1: 精确匹配（MD5 hash）</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>l2_semantic <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># L2: 语义相似（向量数据库）</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>l3_faq <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>        <span class=\"token comment\"># L3: FAQ 预计算</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>l4_model <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span>    <span class=\"token comment\"># L4: LLM 自带缓存（如 Prompt Caching）</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">get</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span> <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># L1: 精确匹配，延迟 &lt; 1ms</span>\n        key <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> hashlib<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>md5<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>encode<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>hexdigest<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> key <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>l1_exact<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>l1_exact<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>key<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># L2: 语义相似，延迟 &lt; 10ms</span>\n        embedding <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_embed<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        similar <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>l2_semantic<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>search<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> threshold<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0.95</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> similar<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> similar<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>answer\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># L3: FAQ 匹配</span>\n        faq_answer <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_match_faq<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> faq_answer<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> faq_answer\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>策略 4：上下文裁剪</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">RAG 检索结果从 top-10 减到 top-5（经 rerank 后 top-5 已足够）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">对话历史及时摘要压缩（减少 30% context token）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">工具返回结果预筛选，只保留关键字段</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>策略 5：Token 预算管控</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">TokenBudgetManager</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"4 级 Token 预算体系\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>global_daily_limit <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">100_000_000</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 全局日预算</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>session_limit <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">10_000</span>           <span class=\"token comment\"># 每会话预算</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>turn_limit <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">2_000</span>               <span class=\"token comment\"># 每轮预算</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>request_limit <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">500</span>              <span class=\"token comment\"># 每请求预算</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">check_budget</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> scope<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> used<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> limit<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> used <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> limit <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.8</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 触发预警，限制 max_tokens</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 需要降级处理</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>三、实际效果参考</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化项</th>\n<th>优化前</th>\n<th>优化后</th>\n<th>提升</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>月均 Token 消耗</td>\n<td>180M</td>\n<td>52M</td>\n<td>-71%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>月均 API 费用</td>\n<td>$2,700</td>\n<td>$780</td>\n<td>-71%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均响应时间</td>\n<td>3.2s</td>\n<td>0.8s</td>\n<td>-75%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回答质量</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n<td>下降 &lt; 2%</td>\n<td>几乎无损</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"缓存命中率多少算合格？\"</strong> — 总命中率 20-30% 算良好（L1 8% + L2 7% + L3 5%）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"模型路由的判断依据是什么？\"</strong> — 基于查询特征（长度、关键词、意图）、历史该类问题的失败率</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">❌ \"一味追求最低成本\" — 客服场景满意度下降 1% 可能导致更大业务损失</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">❌ \"缓存 TTL 设置过长\" — 知识库更新后缓存数据过期，导致回答错误</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}